  "titre": "Nouveauté",
  "contenu": "<div><div align=\"left\" class=\"wcustomhtml\" id=\"649473635946464041\" style=\"width: 100%; overflow-y: hidden;\"><div id=\"bloc-n15\"></div>\n</div>\n<div><div align=\"left\" class=\"wcustomhtml\" id=\"798751356499251194\" style=\"width: 100%; overflow-y: hidden;\"><h2 id=\"nouveaute-15mai\">une nouvelle nappe</h2></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"paragraph\">début de la nouveauté</div>\n<div><div class=\"wsite-image wsite-image-border-none\" style=\"padding-top:10px;padding-bottom:10px;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;text-align:center\">\n<a>\n<img alt=\"Picture\" src=\"https://bakasabl.weebly.com/uploads/1/3/2/3/132352386/farandole-120-6x120-6-426_orig.jpg\" style=\"width:auto;max-width:100%\"/>\n</a>\n<div style=\"display:block;font-size:90%\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<div><div align=\"left\" class=\"wcustomhtml\" id=\"730232321234708408\" style=\"width: 100%; overflow-y: hidden;\"><div id=\"nouveaute-fin\"></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"paragraph\">suite de la page : ce n'est plus une nouveauté<br/></div>\n<h2 class=\"wsite-content-title\"><font size=\"3\">blabla</font></h2>\n<div class=\"paragraph\">'écran led5 niveaux d'assistance a été remplacé par un afficheur lcd beaucoup plus performant : Vitesse instantanée / Vitesse moyenne / Vitesse maximale / Temps / Distance / Kilométrage total / Puissance moteur et<br/></div>\n<div><div align=\"left\" class=\"wcustomhtml\" id=\"266701841340073152\" style=\"width: 100%; overflow-y: hidden;\"><script>\nwindow.addEventListener(\"load\", function() {\n\n  const hash = window.location.hash;\n  if (!hash) return;\n\n  const applyFilter = () => {\n    const target = document.querySelector(hash);\n    if (!target) return;\n\n    let bloc = target;\n    while (bloc && !bloc.classList.contains(\"container\")) {\n      bloc = bloc.parentElement;\n    }\n    if (!bloc) return;\n\n    document.querySelectorAll(\".container\").forEach(el => {\n      el.style.display = \"none\";\n    });\n\n    bloc.style.display = \"block\";\n  };\n\n  // □ on applique plusieurs fois (sécurise le rendu)\n  setTimeout(applyFilter, 100);\n  setTimeout(applyFilter, 500);\n  setTimeout(applyFilter, 1000);\n\n  // □ on observe les changements DOM de Weebly\n  const observer = new MutationObserver(() => {\n    applyFilter();\n  });\n\n  observer.observe(document.body, {\n    childList: true,\n    subtree: true\n  });\n\n});\n</script></div>\n</div>\n</div>",
  "lien_site": "https://bakasabl.weebly.com/ess.html"
}